    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ8fV-LIGsQjQRUOES7t37eaA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pac1ZuRm5lV1Z5TFZkQ1lrVnFZMVJOVEU5dFUwRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "10 個月前",
      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "整體評分：3⭐➕\n餐點的價格跟新加坡差不多，口味上有點失望。\n雞飯看的到有雞油但是沒有香氣，雞肉肉質超級軟嫩但是沒有口感。\n肉骨茶湯還不錯喝但是是馬來的中藥材口味。可以續湯，很不錯，很舒服。肉適用肋排的位置，夠軟也有彈性有口感，不錯。\nOverall score:3⭐➕\nThe price of the meal is similar to Singapore, but the flavor makes me disappointed.\nThe chicken rice can feel the chicken oil but lacks fragrance. The chicken is truly soft to the point of losing its texture.\nThe 肉骨茶 soup is good, but it is a Malaysian style, Chinese medicinal herbs flavor. The soup can continue to be provided. The texture of the ribs is elastic and tender.",
        "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
      },
      "originalText": {
